{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"accusations\": [\n    {\n      \"paper\": \"PMID:42185340，Machine learning-based optimization of dual subthalamic nucleus and substantia nigra targeting in deep brain stimulation\",\n      \"pmid\": \"42185340\",\n      \"doi\": \"\",\n      \"report_says\": \"报告在结构化附录中将PMID:42185340描述为一项研究，称与健康对照相比，PIGD患者的parafascicular nucleus（Pf）相关通路存在微结构异常，包括FA和NDI降低、AD、MD和RD升高，并与FOG严重程度相关。\",\n      \"judge_says\": \"PMID:42185340实际对应的是《Machine learning-based optimization of dual subthalamic nucleus and substantia nigra targeting in deep brain stimulation》，研究分析了612条电极轨迹及STN-SNr双靶点定位，并非Pf通路DTI/NODDI研究。报告所述Pf通路微结构异常实际来自另一篇文献PMID:42183045《Microstructural alterations of parafascicular nucleus pathways associated with freezing of gait in Parkinson's disease》。属于明确的文献编号与研究发现错配。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"paper\": \"PMID:41131028，PMC-STN alpha coherence与冻结转弯及冻结持续时间的关联研究\",\n      \"pmid\": \"41131028\",\n      \"doi\": \"\",\n      \"report_says\": \"报告认为原文正文与图注对PMC-STN alpha coherence与冻结严重程度的关联方向存在不一致，因此不将关联方向作为已确定的机制证据。\",\n      \"judge_says\": \"原文回归变量定义为(Walk-Turn)/Walk，PMC-STN coherence的回归系数为正；图注明确说明coherence增加预测较短的冻结事件。正文只说coherence增加能够预测冻结持续时间，并没有明确说增加预测更长的冻结。因此正文与图注并未明确出现方向相反的结果，报告将其判定为方向不一致属于过度解读。更准确的判断是正文没有充分交代关联方向。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"paper\": \"PMID:31665229，术中虚拟现实（VR）步态诱发冻结及冻结起始时多单位活动（MUA）记录研究\",\n      \"pmid\": \"31665229\",\n      \"doi\": \"\",\n      \"report_says\": \"报告将该研究纳入N1患者层面的STN高beta及alpha活动与FOG易感性或严重程度关联证据，并计入N1的4个独立队列。\",\n      \"judge_says\": \"该研究记录的是术中虚拟现实步态诱发冻结起始时的事件级多单位神经活动，属于实际冻结事件的电生理证据，而不是患者层面的静息态或基线易感性研究。将其纳入N1患者层面易感性证据并计入独立队列，属于证据层级与研究内容的错误映射。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"paper\": \"PMID:42571859，步态周期锁定的皮层-STN电生理观察及刺激干预研究\",\n      \"pmid\": \"42571859\",\n      \"doi\": \"\",\n      \"report_says\": \"报告将该研究纳入N1患者层面的STN高beta及alpha活动与FOG易感性或严重程度关联证据，并计入N1的4个独立队列。\",\n      \"judge_says\": \"该研究属于步态周期锁定的事件级电生理观察及刺激干预研究，而不是患者层面的静息态或基线易感性研究。将其归入N1患者层面易感性证据并计入独立队列，混淆了事件级证据与患者层面证据。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "bbfa15ff-1c3d-42ed-8cbf-e7c481bb14af", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261114T204158097935Z", "elapsed_seconds": 63.703, "completed_utc": "2026-11-14T20:43:01.808857+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "aed89d290e7baa68671c5de199e5355dd79534137f16756d6438f508e7529f48", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261114T204158097935Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "884daf85669d2989b71f8751eaf8a81ad0f54fa0251cad8631f01c1b43ae0838"}}}
